{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And they shall be ready.</b> So that the body too would be pure and prepared for prophecy — not the soul alone. This is because the level of prophecy destined for them then was face to face, while they were still making use of their senses. For this reason a wife was forbidden to Moses once he reached this level, so that all his prophecy from the time of the giving of the Torah onward would be face to face, as it says: לֵךְ אֱמֹר לָהֶם שׁוּבוּ לָכֶם לְאָהֳלֵיכֶם, וְאַתָּה פֹּה עֲמֹד עִמָּדִי (Deuteronomy 5:27–28), as our Sages of blessed memory explained (Shabbat 87a)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:17.113957004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}